val39=$val39<br>	On peut alors calculer \(\cos{\widehat{C B A}}	\times\cos{\widehat{A C B}}\times\sin{\widehat{B A C}}+\cos{\widehat{B A C}}\times	\sin{\widehat{A C B}}=$val23\)
